1
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,800
Hand over the weapons right now,

2
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,399
and we might spare your worthless life.

3
00:00:17,399 --> 00:00:18,320
Or else...

4
00:00:31,519 --> 00:00:32,799
You all heard that, right?

5
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:36,640
A confession straight from Deputy Chief Zhou.

6
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,079
Zhou Kun.

7
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,880
I entrusted the entire department to you,

8
00:00:54,079 --> 00:00:56,880
never expecting you'd defy the law

9
00:00:57,640 --> 00:00:59,000
and commit such crimes.

10
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,719
Mingyuan!

11
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,959
He killed your father!

12
00:01:07,959 --> 00:01:09,280
How can you still believe him?

13
00:01:10,959 --> 00:01:12,400
I'm not dead yet!

14
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,760
Deputy Chief Zhou.

15
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:21,079
To rid the station of a cancer like you,

16
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,319
I made a huge sacrifice!

17
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,439
Lian Ye...

18
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,000
You want to kill me?

19
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,719
Did it really have to come to this?

20
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:39,959
Only if I kill you

21
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:41,959
will the mole believe

22
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:44,319
my hatred for Lian Ye has peaked,

23
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:46,280
and that I'll bring him to justice.

24
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:48,200
Isolated and helpless,

25
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,239
and abandoned by all,

26
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:53,120
we can finally lure the snake out.

27
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,319
How could I ever

28
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:04,959
so easily buy into the ronin's lies?

29
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:07,959
I was just beating them at their own game.

30
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,280
The moment Xu Jie died,

31
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:11,680
I already knew

32
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,120
you were the real mole in the department.

33
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:16,719
Talk!

34
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:19,159
Who ordered you back then

35
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,360
to cover up my parents' case?

36
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,360
I...

37
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:24,840
I...

38
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:28,400
Don't move!

39
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,080
Zhou Kun, drop the gun!

40
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,639
Stay back, Mingyuan!

41
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,360
Drop the gun! Don't make things worse!

42
00:02:34,879 --> 00:02:35,680
Stay back!

43
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:37,840
After him!

44
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:38,719
Are you all right, Dad?

45
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:40,000
I'm fine. Go after him, hurry!

46
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:11,479
Comrade Li Mingyuan,

47
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,400
since joining the police department,

48
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,120
has cracked numerous major cases

49
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:17,639
and rooted out the moles in the force.

50
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:18,919
His service has been exemplary.

51
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:19,879
I hereby announce

52
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,159
the appointment of Comrade Li Mingyuan

53
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,159
as Deputy Chief of Rongcheng Police.

54
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,840
effective immediately.

55
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,000
What are you doing? What's going on?

56
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,879
Congrats on the post, Deputy Chief Li.

57
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,919
Captain Xu, look what I've got for you.

58
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:25,279
A Type 38 rifle.

59
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,199
How did you get your hands on it?

60
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:39,680
Lian Ye,

61
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,759
that shipment of weapons...

62
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,120
I want it.

63
00:04:45,519 --> 00:04:46,160
How much do you want?

64
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,319
Half of it.

65
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:52,439
Alright.

66
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:57,720
Aren't you going to ask me...

67
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,959
why I need these arms?

68
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,279
You...

69
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,079
You rarely ask anything of me.

70
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,000
Whatever you want, it's yours.

71
00:05:10,879 --> 00:05:11,600
Besides,

72
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,680
you would never hurt me.

73
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:21,040
Just consider it...

74
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,319
a gift from Lian Ye to the guerrillas.

75
00:05:23,839 --> 00:05:24,639
That's great.

76
00:05:25,639 --> 00:05:26,800
Lian Ye is so capable.

77
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:29,319
You should recruit him to our side.

78
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:32,319
His vengeance isn't settled yet. No rush.

79
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,439
We'll talk about it later.

80
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,399
With this firepower in our hands,

81
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:46,839
when we take on the Japanese,

82
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,079
we're bound to win.

83
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,079
Brother Lian, Brother Dali.

84
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:02,800
Let me take a look.

85
00:06:05,759 --> 00:06:06,360
Doing well.

86
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,000
Much better.

87
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,319
Thanks to the doctor you brought,

88
00:06:09,639 --> 00:06:10,639
Xiao Hou's health...

89
00:06:10,639 --> 00:06:11,959
is recovering step by step.

90
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,439
Thank you.

91
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,199
Right.

92
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:16,079
Deputy Chief Li caught the arms smugglers

93
00:06:16,079 --> 00:06:17,120
in one clean sweep,

94
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,560
and wants me to ID them at the station.

95
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,680
Jiaxing and Jintu's killers are all there.

96
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,360
Surviving a near-death ordeal...

97
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,279
brings good fortune in the future.

98
00:06:26,199 --> 00:06:28,800
You rascal, stop running up the mountain.

99
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:31,160
I... I'll never dare to again!

100
00:06:34,319 --> 00:06:35,360
Thank you, Brother Dali. Thank you, Dali.

101
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:36,120
Thank you, Brother Lian.

102
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:36,800
Good.

103
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:45,800
Yuna.

104
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,399
Take aim. Fire.

105
00:07:01,839 --> 00:07:03,079
Try it yourself.

106
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,160
Shoot.

107
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,360
President Sun.

108
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,680
Look at the state you're in.

109
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,680
Mr. Matsui...

110
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,759
Such a sweet apple.

111
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:40,120
Yet my heart is so bitter.

112
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:46,800
Regarding the munitions,

113
00:07:47,560 --> 00:07:48,839
the Major General is extremely displeased.

114
00:07:49,519 --> 00:07:51,759
He ordered us, at all costs,

115
00:07:52,319 --> 00:07:54,240
to get Rongcheng's coastal defense map.

116
00:07:55,319 --> 00:07:56,839
You know what to do, don't you?

117
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,959
I... I swear...

118
00:07:59,959 --> 00:08:01,920
I pledge my life to fulfill the order

119
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,120
and deliver the coastal defense map!

120
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:08,959
President Sun, get up. Get up.

121
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:36,879
The floor is cold.

122
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,759
Hurry up and get on your feet.

123
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,080
Miss?

124
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,120
A ghost! It's a ghost!

125
00:08:59,000 --> 00:08:59,519
Come in.

126
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:09,519
Chief Li.

127
00:09:09,919 --> 00:09:11,559
We've run into a tricky case.

128
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,759
Two women have been murdered.

129
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:14,240
Both were brutally tortured before dying.

130
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,639
The killer was utterly ruthless.

131
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:16,759
We've investigated for quite some time,

132
00:09:16,759 --> 00:09:17,840
but haven't found a single lead.

133
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,080
You're experienced in solving cases.

134
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:20,840
Please take a look at this.

135
00:09:26,559 --> 00:09:29,399
Bai Yumei, Minchun Pavilion top courtesan.

136
00:09:29,679 --> 00:09:31,080
Cause of death: drowning.

137
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,600
The body is decomposing.

138
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,200
Estimated time of death: about a week ago.

139
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:39,240
Liu Furong, Minchun Pavilion prostitute.

140
00:09:39,639 --> 00:09:41,399
Died of massive blood loss.

141
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:43,919
Time of death: one day ago.

142
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,639
The same pattern.

143
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:48,519
Similar backgrounds.

144
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,840
Close times of death.

145
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,080
Merge them into one case.

146
00:09:51,519 --> 00:09:52,639
Search Minchun Pavilion first,

147
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,039
then look into Club Jasmine.

148
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,240
Yes, Chief.

149
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:02,480
Chief, invites from the Shipboard Guild,

150
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,080
Matsui Chamber of Commerce and others.

151
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:06,720
Next time you enter, remember to knock.

152
00:10:07,799 --> 00:10:08,840
Understood, Chief.

153
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:09,639
Work hard.

154
00:10:10,639 --> 00:10:12,039
Just like your brother Xu Jie,

155
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,440
be a good cop.

156
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,799
Yes, Chief.

157
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,480
Dismissed.

158
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:43,759
Move!

159
00:10:43,919 --> 00:10:45,480
Watch it! This stuff is expensive!

160
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,759
Stop!

161
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,399
Don't run! Out of the way!

162
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:52,399
Out of the way!

163
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,200
Stop right there!

164
00:10:54,919 --> 00:10:55,639
Stop!

165
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,480
I knew it was you.

166
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:04,639
You...

167
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:05,799
Take her away!

168
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:06,960
I don't know you!

169
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,039
Let go of me!

170
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,159
Let me go!

171
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,679
Didn't you hear her tell you to let go?

172
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,360
None of your damn business!

173
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,879
Watch how you talk to Brother Lian!

174
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,799
Oh, it's Hall Master Lian.

175
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,639
She's our boss's runaway concubine.

176
00:11:20,759 --> 00:11:22,200
We're under orders to bring her back.

177
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,440
A runaway concubine?

178
00:11:26,679 --> 00:11:27,919
Is he telling the truth?

179
00:11:27,919 --> 00:11:30,159
No! I'm no runaway concubine!

180
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,639
I don't even know who they are!

181
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:32,320
You bitch!

182
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,559
What kind of bullshit is that?

183
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:42,799
Do you have a Good Citizen Pass?

184
00:11:43,519 --> 00:11:45,320
Yes, yes, I do!

185
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,840
Boss Chen, sorry to bother you.

186
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,639
Could you take a look at this badge?

187
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,919
Officer Yu.

188
00:12:17,399 --> 00:12:19,759
Is there a problem with this badge?

189
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:21,600
In the two recent cases,

190
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,639
both victims wore this on their chests.

191
00:12:24,080 --> 00:12:25,080
I wanted to ask

192
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,840
if it has any special meaning.

193
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:29,360
It's for Club Jasmine's 2nd anniversary,

194
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:30,519
a custom commemorative badge.

195
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,840
Only 100 were made,

196
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,879
given out randomly to interested guests.

197
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,399
Nothing really special.

198
00:12:38,679 --> 00:12:41,000
Officer Yu, if I may ask,

199
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:42,919
who were the victims?

200
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,320
Prostitutes from Minchun Pavilion.
